			<div class="content" id="post-content-4441316">
									

<p>Thank you to the following users for their feedback and sharpening of this story:</p>
<p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/prlosash" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5257365); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5257365&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578341774" alt="PrLosash" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5257365)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/prlosash" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5257365); return false;">PrLosash</a></span><br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5336470); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5336470&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578341774" alt="cybersqyd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5336470)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5336470); return false;">cybersqyd</a></span><br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578341774" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4916887)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;">MalyceGraves</a></span> (BIG THANK YOU for formatting help!)</p>
<p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-12815663/just-a-light-in-some-fog-and-some-time-manipulation">Greenlight thread</a></p>
<p>Added a dinky little image I whipped up using basic paint effects until I can land something better.</p>
<p>Edit: I’ve had quite a few rates without the needle moving much, so I suppose there’s some division here. While it’s obviously not obligatory, I welcome any and all comments, including from those who don’t like it. Since I’m a greenlighter, it’s important for me to have an idea of what isn’t working in my own article.</p>
<p>Edit 2: I didn't want to do this initially, but I think some people are downvoting because the big answer behind this that makes things click isn't explicitly stated, and while a couple of people have gotten it, I'm getting the impression that many people are not. So here's what's behind the redactions and such:</p>
<p><strong>The Big Secret</strong><br />
Individuals (and their instances) become smaller and more compact (so very small, so very close) as they approach the center, they would appear from the outside to be a light. Just as well, those tiny, tiny, <em>tiny</em> instances would then become the dust itself, meaning they were wiping <em>people</em> from their camera lenses (hence the biological makeup of the dust). It would be redacted by the Foundation because the ethics of that whole situation would likely complicate the relatively easy containment they're managing already.</p>
<p>I was inspired by 2719 to write a &quot;mystery SCP&quot; that had a definite answer, but required a bit of work to figure it out. Maybe it's too much. Either way, if this answer helps makes everything make more sense, I hope it might be reevaluated with the knowledge that I wasn't using the black boxes to escape questions I didn't know the answer to.</p>
<p>Edit 2: Removed some redactions that seemed to be more trouble that they were worth.</p>

