			<div class="content" id="post-content-4441339">
									

<p>I'm glad to see this posted. I really enjoyed the narrative here, and the dialogue between the Foundation staff and the D-class really gave the impression of real people. I know that most of the Foundation staff have become desensitized to the often gruesome ends the D-class come to, but I'm sure some of them still see the D-class as human. It is important to remember that even though most of the D-class are reprobates, they're all still human and we should recognize that humanity.</p>
<p>To fail to do so would be to risk losing our own.</p>

